 "author": "irpina",
 "description": "Places in the Octatrack's firmware that a mod intercepts, one mod at a time: MIDI notes on a listening track and the MIDI tracks' notes on their way out, the CHROMATIC keyboard, p-locks and knobs, the settings and the project file. A mod adds a record to the event instead of patching the place, so mods that need these places combine, and a record means what it means on Modwerk's Octatrack base, whose events these are. On its own it changes nothing the unit does.",
